31m< left\u001b[0m / \u001b[32mright >\u001b[0m :\n\u001b[31m<\u001b[0m\u001b[31m\"Invalid character \\'\\\u001b[0m\u001b[31mn\\' at position 5\"\u001b[0m\n\u001b[32m>\u001b[0m\u001b[32m\"Invalid character \\'\\\u001b[0m\u001b[1;48;5;22;32m\\\u001b[0m\u001b[32mn\\' at position 5\"\u001b[0m", "test_sources": [{"commit": "764ee61536cbeb8cfbce6dba61c1b85398700bb6", "paths": ["src/error.rs"]}], "tests": ["error::tests::test_display"]}, "shard": "hex", "status": "confirmed", "subject": "Fix Error::InvalidHexCharacter::to_string", "summary": "FromHexError::InvalidHexCharacter formatted control characters literally, so a newline produced a multiline error message. The fix uses debug formatting to escape the character. The existing test_display test, updated by this fix, expects an escaped newline at position 5.", "updated_at": "2026-09-24T00:19:19.556363+00:00"}
